WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:07.059
[classical music] No. No, none of that
trash for me. But perhaps that small jug.

cue-2
00:00:07.059 --> 00:00:10.340
What does it say there beneath the
picture?

cue-3
00:00:11.039 --> 00:00:17.879
Aye, my husband is dining within but he
cares nothing for politics. Oh! Look,

cue-4
00:00:17.879 --> 00:00:21.620
Charlotte, at the Crown. They are firing
on the crowd.

cue-5
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:27.500
Election time makes people run wild. One
reads constantly in the papers of riot and

cue-6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.799
violence up and down the country, all
brought on by the prospect of a poll.
